{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The Void is devouring the ancient realm of Northanda.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/4bf8f82f80d5873e3f4ba83972d1e6f0.webp?t=1768570431\" width=535 height=30 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/bd622f003b1e32b64c76ea61c4c464a1.poster.avif?t=1768570431\" width=1170 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/bd622f003b1e32b64c76ea61c4c464a1.webm?t=1768570431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a party of legendary heroes in this tactical role-based deckbuilder. Master strategic battles with deep synergies between cards and heroes based on their roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/8243347e6be17beb513a9dd5afd0448d.webp?t=1768570431\" width=234 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the party alive with extra resources, card manipulation, and powerful buffs at just the right moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/404e4ba18f73aa3dd7b36f42a20c4734.webp?t=1768570431\" width=234 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit enemy weaknesses with devastating attacks, scale into powerful combinations to overpower your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/3cdfe162a959c7772aeacbb6c960aa9d.webp?t=1768570431\" width=234 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw enemy focus and shield allies from harm by redirecting attacks and mitigating incoming damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/e8cfd452db139571897b9fac5a01d90d.webp?t=1768570431\" width=393 height=27 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/71d46e25b5c1e1f8e6f342fe9f094f4a.poster.avif?t=1768570431\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/71d46e25b5c1e1f8e6f342fe9f094f4a.webm?t=1768570431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit three heroes from countless possible combinations to form an unbreakable team. Each hero brings their own card library and playstyle, unlocking wildly different synergies and endless ways to personalize your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/c2ba64e19217ee1c8aa7f616734601ef.webp?t=1768570431\" alt=\"chart your own path\" width=376 height=27 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/136e2b0d6525904872715a2951ef97ff.poster.avif?t=1768570431\" width=1170 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/136e2b0d6525904872715a2951ef97ff.webm?t=1768570431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate dangerous dungeons through <strong>Encounter Cards</strong>, each offering unique risks and rewards. Face encounters in any order, or set up camp to wait out the harsh night. Pick your battles wisely as you journey toward each dungeon's corrupted heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/78a2043c2aec817cf5f474d5f01fbd30.webp?t=1768570431\" width=333 height=27 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/4d97393fdff261248a1b6d4d0ffe30fa.poster.avif?t=1768570431\" width=1170 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/4d97393fdff261248a1b6d4d0ffe30fa.webm?t=1768570431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your heroes share a single deck, but each hero controls their own mana pool, which regenerates slowly over time. The most powerful combos require clever deckbuilding and cooperation between heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/e7701fda535fc21cf7e69f75445d2513.webp?t=1768570431\" width=349 height=27 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/b03f7cacf8a05f9ae8272ff8aaaac64d.poster.avif?t=1768570431\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/b03f7cacf8a05f9ae8272ff8aaaac64d.webm?t=1768570431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger through deep and branching upgrade paths. Each run offers new ways to grow stronger and push back the Void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 Discover powerful <strong>Artifacts</strong> that redefine how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 Enhance cards with <strong>Gems</strong> to unlock their full potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 Seek\u00a0<strong>Blessings</strong>\u00a0from the ancient Aspects for otherworldly power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 Use tactical <strong>Items</strong> to overcome obstacles, and open new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/752a58d951285f8096d32856cbd4ce58.webp?t=1768570431\" width=325 height=27 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/d0795247e7afdec177bd3cc8544c397c.poster.avif?t=1768570431\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/d0795247e7afdec177bd3cc8544c397c.webm?t=1768570431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2068650?t=1768570431","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/5780af9a4889a4785b5b6fb8b50232b1127aa7b8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768570431","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/d2e2269f00c0a3d3346f2dbab7db0bc6c7acc187/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768570431","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/d2e2269f00c0a3d3346f2dbab7db0bc6c7acc187/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768570431","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Remote Play on Phone","id":41},{"description":"Remote Play on Tablet","id":42},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2901270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/0e0667004954b6253382b4bd5ebc9e3b.webp?t=1768570431\" width=173 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39Recruit and lead a party of <strong>three heroes</strong>, each with distinct roles and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39Build a <strong>shared deck</strong> and balance party resources to unleash devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39Discover powerful <strong>artifacts, blessings, and socketable gems</strong> to customize your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39Navigate treacherous dungeons filled with <strong>meaningful choices and tactical decisions</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39Master <strong>role-driven combat</strong> with a unique mana system that rewards clever deckbuilding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39Enjoy <strong>endless replayability</strong>\u00a0with countless hero combinations and card synergies.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The Void is devouring the ancient realm of Northanda.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/4bf8f82f80d5873e3f4ba83972d1e6f0.webp?t=1768570431\" width=535 height=30 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/bd622f003b1e32b64c76ea61c4c464a1.poster.avif?t=1768570431\" width=1170 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/bd622f003b1e32b64c76ea61c4c464a1.webm?t=1768570431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a party of legendary heroes in this tactical role-based deckbuilder. Master strategic battles with deep synergies between cards and heroes based on their roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/8243347e6be17beb513a9dd5afd0448d.webp?t=1768570431\" width=234 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the party alive with extra resources, card manipulation, and powerful buffs at just the right moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/404e4ba18f73aa3dd7b36f42a20c4734.webp?t=1768570431\" width=234 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit enemy weaknesses with devastating attacks, scale into powerful combinations to overpower your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/3cdfe162a959c7772aeacbb6c960aa9d.webp?t=1768570431\" width=234 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw enemy focus and shield allies from harm by redirecting attacks and mitigating incoming damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/e8cfd452db139571897b9fac5a01d90d.webp?t=1768570431\" width=393 height=27 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/71d46e25b5c1e1f8e6f342fe9f094f4a.poster.avif?t=1768570431\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/71d46e25b5c1e1f8e6f342fe9f094f4a.webm?t=1768570431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit three heroes from countless possible combinations to form an unbreakable team. Each hero brings their own card library and playstyle, unlocking wildly different synergies and endless ways to personalize your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/c2ba64e19217ee1c8aa7f616734601ef.webp?t=1768570431\" alt=\"chart your own path\" width=376 height=27 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/136e2b0d6525904872715a2951ef97ff.poster.avif?t=1768570431\" width=1170 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/136e2b0d6525904872715a2951ef97ff.webm?t=1768570431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate dangerous dungeons through <strong>Encounter Cards</strong>, each offering unique risks and rewards. Face encounters in any order, or set up camp to wait out the harsh night. Pick your battles wisely as you journey toward each dungeon's corrupted heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/78a2043c2aec817cf5f474d5f01fbd30.webp?t=1768570431\" width=333 height=27 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/4d97393fdff261248a1b6d4d0ffe30fa.poster.avif?t=1768570431\" width=1170 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/4d97393fdff261248a1b6d4d0ffe30fa.webm?t=1768570431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your heroes share a single deck, but each hero controls their own mana pool, which regenerates slowly over time. The most powerful combos require clever deckbuilding and cooperation between heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/e7701fda535fc21cf7e69f75445d2513.webp?t=1768570431\" width=349 height=27 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068650/extras/b03f7cacf8a05f9ae8272ff8aaaac64d.poster.avif?t=1768570431\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://s